## 3. the style the fix had to keep
  The first version put parse() at cyclomatic complexity 11 against swiftlint's 10, fixed by
  extracting headEnd(in:) — which is also where the two ways a head can be missing are read
  together. swiftlint 255 and authored swift-format 743 before this task and after it. The line
  numbers in section 2 were taken before that extraction.
